{"id":705,"date":"2025-08-13T10:06:22","date_gmt":"2025-08-13T08:06:22","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/?page_id=705"},"modified":"2026-04-15T11:22:39","modified_gmt":"2026-04-15T09:22:39","slug":"dario-tagarro","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/members\/dario-tagarro\/","title":{"rendered":"Dar\u00edo Tagarro"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:33.33%\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Dario-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-860\" style=\"width:223px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Dar\u00edo Tagarro is a first-year PhD student in Statistics and Operations Research at the University of Oviedo (Spain), supervised by Enrique Miranda and Ra\u00fal P\u00e9rez-Fern\u00e1ndez. he holds a BsC in Mathematics (2024), where he was distinguished with the award for the best academic record. Additionally, he holds an MsC in Teacher Training (2025), both from the University of Oviedo and he is currently taking postgraduate studies in Data Analysis for Business Intelligence at the University of Oviedo.<\/mark><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">Since 2025, he has been working as a full-time substitute lecturer in the Department of Statistics, Operations Research and Mathematics Education at the University of Oviedo, with experience teaching Statistics across several undergraduate programs, including Commerce and Marketing and various Engineering degrees, and postgraduate programs such as Civil Engineering Master.<\/mark><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">He is a PhD candidate in the early stages of his doctoral research. At this point, he is in the process of building the foundation of his academic and scientific training, exploring the key theoretical and methodological tools that will support his future research. As part of this formative stage, he is actively participating in specialized schools and training programs, such as the BFTA School 2025 held in Granada, Spain.<\/mark><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">His research focuses on studying random sets and second order models on the simplex. More specifically, the objectives of his research include:<\/mark><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">To present statistical real-life applications of random sets on the simplex on the context of compositional data.<\/mark><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">To study comparative probabilities models and their structure on the simplex.<\/mark><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\">To study second order probability models.<\/mark><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Selected Publications<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"><strong>Dar\u00edo Tagarro<\/strong>, Ra\u00fal P\u00e9rez-Fern\u00e1ndez and Enrique Miranda. Confidence intervals with imprecise data. <em>Statistical Papers<\/em>, 67, 39, 2026.<\/mark><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-black-color\"><strong>Dar\u00edo Tagarro<\/strong>, Enrique Miranda and Ra\u00fal P\u00e9rez-Fern\u00e1ndez. An order-theoretic study of the credal sets generated by comparative probabilities. Proceedings of IPMU&#8217;2026 Conference. 2026.<\/mark><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">More info<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www-scopus-com.uniovi.idm.oclc.org\/authid\/detail.uri?authorId=60514901300&amp;origin=resultslist\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"253\" height=\"248\" src=\"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/scopus.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-775\" style=\"width:55px;height:auto\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"384\" src=\"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/orcid.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-777\" style=\"width:134px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\"><div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https:\/\/scholar.google.com\/citations?user=s2gyk5IAAAAJ&amp;hl=es\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http:\/\/imagine-wp.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/scholar.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-776\" style=\"width:47px;height:auto\"\/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected